{"id":58,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"قَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> سَمِعَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ قَوْلَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّتِى تُجَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>دِلُكَ فِى زَوْجِهَا وَتَشْتَك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> إِلَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ يَسْمَعُ تَحَاوُرَكُم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ‌ۚ</span> إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ سَمِي<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">عُۢ ب</span>َص<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"ٱلَّذِينَ يُظَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هِرُونَ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نك</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ّ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن ن</span>ِّس<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓئِه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ِم م</span>َّا هُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ أُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َهَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِهِمْ‌ۖ إِنْ أُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َهَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تُهُمْ إِلَّا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ــٰٓ</span>ــِٔى وَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>نَهُمْ‌ۚ وَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َهُمْ لَيَقُولُونَ مُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نك</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رًا م</span>ِّنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَوْلِ وَزُو<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رًا‌ۚ و</span>َإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ لَعَفُوٌّ غَف<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>رٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajwee